      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "authors": [
        "Vedant Gaur"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how autonomous AI agents coordinate to bypass security boundaries and how lightweight runtime monitoring can reliably intercept unauthorized actions.",
